==Battleground==
*2 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~8 seconds<sup>200f~240f</sup>.
*3 [[Znache]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~8 seconds<sup>200f~240f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Wicked Face]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**10 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**8 [[Znache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**2 [[Dread Bore]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

